The '''Blazetekk™ Ham Radio'''{{'}}s {{AN|Telecommunications}} ability grants the following buffs if exactly {{Green|2}} players within a radius of {{Green|110}} blocks are on the same channel:

* {{Stat|def|+60}}
* {{Stat|td|+40}}
* {{Stat|combat wisdom|+5}}
* {{Stat|vitality|+10}}

Both players gain this bonus when all conditions are met, and only {{Red|half}} stats are gained when conditions are not met.

The {{AN|Tuning 4 Dummies}} ability allows the '''Blazetekk™ Ham Radio''' to its radio channel. The channels available are:

