If the '''Blazetekk™ Ham Radio''' cannot find another player on the same channel, the following dialogue displays:

{{Dialogue|&7Your radio is weak. Find another enjoyer to boost it.}}

Finding another player on the same channel displays:

{{Dialogue|&7Your radio signal is strong!}}

If {{Green|3}} or more players are on the same channel, following dialogue displays:

{{Dialogue|&7Your radio lost signal. There's too many enjoyers on this channel.}}

Additionally, the {{Item|Bluetooth Ring}} and {{Item|Bluertooth Ring}} grant an additional {{Stat|damage|+3|icononly=true}} and {{Stat|damage|+4|icononly=}} bonus respectively. The two bonuses do not stack with each other and are unaffected by signal strength.

== Trivia ==
*The '''Blazetekk™ Ham Radio's''' perks are similar to the {{Item|Armor of the Pack}}.
* If held in the hotbar, stepping on a pressure plate will rapidly cycle through the radio channels.

